{"title":"Canadian Mathematical Olympiad Qualifying Repêchage","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Canadian Mathematical Olympiad Qualifying Repêchage (CMOQR)</b> is the second of a series of tests held by the Canadian Mathematical Society to determine the Canadian IMO team.  While the top 50 scorers of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Open_Mathematics_Challenge\" title=\"Canadian Open Mathematics Challenge\">COMC</a> can go straight to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Canadian Mathematical Olympiad\">Canadian Mathematical Olympiad</a>, the next 50-75 scorers must take the test before moving on to the CMO.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Mathematical_Olympiad_Qualifying_Rep%C3%AAchage&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Structure\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Participants receive a set of problems that require full solutions.  Unlike most Olympiads, they are allowed one week to write and submit solutions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Mathematical_Olympiad_Qualifying_Rep%C3%AAchage&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cms.math.ca/Competitions/REP/\">Official Site (includes past problems and solutions)</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Mathematical_Olympiad_Qualifying_Rep%C3%AAchage&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017155120\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 405/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.592      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.592      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17589:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017155120 and revision id 147701. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}